    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 5th level, you can attack twice, rather than once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn.</p>\n<p>If you ready your action to make an attack, you can attack the same number of times you would if you had taken the attack action on your turn.</p>\n<p>In addition, whenever you are under the effects of a creation with a range of self, both yourself and your Iron Defender benefit from it.</p>",
